{
  "bodyHash": "tw/nJunLt1E=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC7sSiQ.png\" width=\"408\" height=\"108\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>Delightful</strong> — это модификация для <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>, предлагающая погружение и ориентированная на совместимость с первоначальными модами. Каждая новая функция настраивается.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" alt=\"S'more\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Продукты питания:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Зефир на палочке</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жареный зефир на палочке</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Смурри</strong> (рекомендуется с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>&nbsp;или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;шоколадом)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinigang.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Синиганг</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Чизбургер</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deluxe_cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Делюкс чизбургер</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Банка джема</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/glow_jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Светящаяся банка джема</strong> (светящийся эффект)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_bottle.png\" alt=\"Банка орехового масла\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Банка орехового масла</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_and_jelly_sandwich.png\" alt=\"Бутерброд с ореховым маслом и желе\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Бутерброд с ореховым маслом и желе</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ender_nectar.png\" alt=\"Эндер-нектар\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Эндер-нектар</strong> (одноразовый доступ к эндер-сундуку)<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_flesh.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Мякоть кактуса</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_steak.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Стейк из кактуса</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Полевой салат</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/acorn.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жёлудь</strong> (орех, который выпадает с дубовых листьев)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rock_candy.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;Каменная конфета</strong> (для «forge:gems/rose_quartz», рекомендуется с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;или&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/raw_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Сырой козлятина</strong> (выпадает от козлов)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Готовая козлятина</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сырые оленьи отбивные</strong> (для «forge:raw_venison», рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Готовые оленьи отбивные</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cantaloupe_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ломтик дыни</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InventivetalentDev/minecraft-assets/1.19.2/assets/minecraft/textures/item/pumpkin_pie.png\">&nbsp;Обновление тыквенного пирога</strong> (настраиваемое):</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/pumpkin_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете разместить обычный тыквенный пирог в мире так же, как пирог Farmer's Delight!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/pumpkin_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ломтик тыквенного пирога</strong>, или просто нажмите Правую кнопку мыши, чтобы съесть.</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Ножи</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>Ножи должны быть включены в конфигурации по пути «config/delightful-common.toml».</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> Медный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bone_knife.png\" alt=\"Костяной нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Костяной нож</strong> (рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bone Equipment</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\" alt=\"Аметистовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Аметистовый нож</strong> (рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Equipment</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/emerald_knife.png\" alt=\"Изумрудный нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Изумрудный нож</strong> (рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Emerald Equipment</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Совместимые ножи</strong>&nbsp;(тег)<strong>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/tin_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong> Оловянный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/tin)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Стальной нож</strong> (forge:ingots/steel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bronze_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Бронзовый нож</strong> (forge:ingots/bronze)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/silver_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Серебряный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/silver)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/brass_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Латунный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/brass)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Эндеритовый нож&nbsp;</strong>(forge:ingots/enderite)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/black_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Чёрный опаловый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:gems/black_opal)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/constantan_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Константановый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/constantan)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/electrum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Электрумовый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/electrum)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/invar_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Инваровый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/invar)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lead_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Свинцовый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/lead)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nickel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Никелевый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/nickel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zinc_knife.png\" alt=\"Цинковый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Цинковый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/zinc)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> и дополнений:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyroot_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Нож из скайрута</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/holystone_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из холистона</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zanite_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из занита</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gravitite_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из гравитита</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyjade_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из скайджада</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stratus_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из стратуса</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Нож из веридия</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/infused_veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Нож из инфицированного веридия</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/fiery_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Огненный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ironwood_knife.png\">&nbsp;Нож из железного дерева</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/knightmetal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из нейтметала</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steeleaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из стилеава</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cloggrum_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из клоггрума\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из клоггрума</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/forgotten_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Забытый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Забытый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/froststeel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из морозной стали\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из морозной стали</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/utherium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из утерия\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из утерия</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Tools</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/osmium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из осмия</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lapis_lazuli_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из лазурита</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_glowstone_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из очищенного светящегося камня</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_obsidian_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из очищенного обсидиана</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a>&nbsp;и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/elementium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из элементия\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из элементия</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/manasteel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из манастила\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из манастила</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/terra_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из терры\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из терры</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/alf_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из альфа\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из альфа</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a></strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Нож из деорума</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/reinforced_deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Усиленный нож из деорума</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/draco_arcanus_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из драко аркануса</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff &amp; Additions</a><strong>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_quartz_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a><strong>Нож из позолоченного кварца</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/experience_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из опыта</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blazing_knife.png\" alt=\"Огненный нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a>Огненный нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из адамантия</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/mythril_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из мифрила</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/onyx_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из оникса</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/thyrium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из тирюма</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinisite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из синизита</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rose_gold_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Розовое золото\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из розового золота</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_netherite_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Позолоченный нож из незерита\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Позолоченный нож из незерита</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crystalline_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из кристаллического материала</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stellium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из стеллиума</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ores-above-diamonds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ores Above Diamonds</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\">&nbsp;Аметистовый нож</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/netherite_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из незеритового опала</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Одиночные ножи:</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из адамантия</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/living_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Живой нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roots-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roots Classic</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/warden_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из вардена</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">)</a></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/obsidian_infused_enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из обсидиана, инфицированного эндеритом</strong> (для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">LieOnLion's Enderite</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgwrFK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Нож из душевной стали</strong>&nbsp;(для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spirit</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/necronium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из некрония\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Нож из некрония</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantasmic</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/allthemodium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из аллтемодия</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/leaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Нож из листьев</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seeds</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/kiwano_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Нож из кивано</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Ягоды лосося</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Семена салмонберри</strong> — это вкусная новая ягода, которая появляется в лесах. Они полезны в качестве перекуса на ходу или в рецептах, требующих ягод, таких как&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ягодное матча-латте</strong>.</p>\n<p>Они являются особым ингредиентом для&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Пирога из семян салмонберри</strong> (который можно&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;нарезать) и&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>Мороженого из семян салмонберри</strong> (рекомендуется с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Неаполитанским</a>)</p>\n<p>Ягоды можно превратить в&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pips.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Семена салмонберри</strong> и посадить их (вдохновлено модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a>).</p>\n<p>Однако&nbsp;<strong>кусты салмонберри</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">требуют дождя и света</span>, чтобы быстро расти.</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/salmonberry_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мешок салмонберри</strong> — это блок для хранения и декорации ваших ягод (вдохновлен модом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>).</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Матча</strong><strong>:</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_tea_leaf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Листья зелёного чая</strong>&nbsp;можно получить, используя нож на блоках «Листья» (случайно). Листья зелёного чая из&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite</a>&nbsp;совместимы и рекомендованы.</p>\n<p>Их можно приготовить в горшке до состояния&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Матча</strong>, концентрированного чайного порошка.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Затем это можно использовать для приготовления двух восхитительных латте с эффектами:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Латте с матча</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ягодное латте с матча</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мороженое с матча</strong> (рекомендуется с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жир и масло:</span><br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Жир животного</strong> может выпасть случайно из любого «жирного» животного (отмеченного тегом «delightful:fatty_animals»), с некоторой поддержкой совместимости.</p>\n<p>Жир можно приготовить в&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_oil_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Бутылку животного масла</strong>, которая является топливом для печи со специальной способностью: простое нажатие правой кнопкой мыши с удержанием Shift мгновенно заправит печь.</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span>&nbsp;Блоки:<br></strong></span></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/acorn_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;Мешок с жёлудями</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVJANTM.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мини-дыня</strong> (спавнится в равнинах)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/cantaloupe_side_small.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Дыня</strong>&nbsp;(спавнится на пляжах)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/quartz_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;Шкаф из кварца</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;Шкаф из базальта</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/246/22/637155296232619409.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>:</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/blueberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/green_apple_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie.png\">&nbsp;Переработка пирогов</strong> (отключите любой элемент нарезки, чтобы выключить):</p>\n<p>(рекомендуется с текстурным пакетом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/blueberry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/green_apple_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/nightshade_berry_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/crimson_berry_pie_top.png\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете разместить любой пирог из <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span> в мире как пирог <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blueberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_apple_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;кусочек пирога</strong>, или просто нажмите правой кнопкой мыши, чтобы съесть его. Пирог будет давать тот же эффект зелья, что и раньше.</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/565/915/637924211543296813.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/1.19.x/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/items/source_berry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Переработка пирога из ягод источника</strong> (отключите элемент нарезки, чтобы выключить):</p>\n<p>(рекомендуется с текстурным пакетом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/source_berry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете разместить пирог из ягод источника <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau</span> в мире так же, как и пирог <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/source_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;кусочек пирога из ягод источника</strong>, или просто нажмите правой кнопкой мыши, чтобы съесть его. Пирог будет давать тот же эффект зелья, что и раньше.</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong><strong>:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/chopped_clover.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Измельчённый клевер</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lavender_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Лавандовый чай</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/483/128/637782721029825410.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Для </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></strong><strong>:</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/coconut_curry.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Кокосовое карри</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/honey_glazed_walnut.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Орех, глазированный мёдом</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/prickly_pear_juice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сок опунции</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/azalea_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Чай из азалии</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
